OL,3,GNEWSALife in jail for pair who used
OL,4,Airon to murder man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman who beat another man
OL,7,Fto death using a domestic iron in what
OL,8,Fa judge described as a "brutal and
OL,9,Fmerciless attack" have been jailed for
OL,10,Flife.
OL,12,FJaroslav Daniszewski, 43, was found
OL,13,Fdead at the home of Abigniew Chlebek,
OL,14,F67, in Stead Street, Shipley, on 22
OL,15,FApril 2025.
OL,17,FFollowing a trial at Bradford Crown
OL,18,FCourt, Chlebek and Beata Walczak, 58,
OL,19,Fof Barkerend Road, Bradford, were both
OL,20,Ffound guilty of his murder and were
OL,21,Feach sentenced on Thursday to nearly 15
OL,22,Fyears in prison.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
