OL,3,GNEWSALife in jail for pair who used
OL,4,Airon to murder man
OL,5,
OL,6,FSentencing the pair, Judge Geoffrey
OL,7,FMarson said Daniszewski had suffered a
OL,8,F"brutal assault with multiple blows"
OL,9,Fand had "little or no chance of
OL,10,Fdefending himself".
